# Damage thresholds in the debug VS match on Final Destination: Link
# (player 1) against a CPU Mario who attacks, two stocks each, with Your
# damage and Opponents' damage set to Thresholds in the port menu's
# Accessibility category on the title screen. Link walks over and jabs
# until Mario's damage is said in the opponents' voice, then waits for
# Mario's hits to make his own said in your voice. A jab's few points
# cross nothing, so most settled figures go unsaid: each one said has
# crossed a multiple of the damage interval since the last said, which
# run_level.py checks against the interval in the run's a11y.ini. About
# 40 seconds.
# Run from Git Bash with the debug match switches, muted, as for a player,
# since the port menu's reader needs accessibility on (run_level.py sets
# the switches):
#   MELEE_DEBUG_VS=cpu MELEE_DEBUG_VS_STOCKS=2 \
#     python tools/a11y/drive.py --muted tools/a11y/match_thresholds.drive

# The port menu on the title screen: Up past Quit game and Resume to
# Accessibility, the last category, then down its rows past Speech and the
# voices' eight and the Match announcements switch to the damage rows, each
# a step Right from Every change to Thresholds, saved by the option's name.
wait "state 0 scene 0$"
sleep 1
key F1
wait '"PC settings\. Graphics\. '
key Up Up Up
wait '"Accessibility"$'
key Right
wait '"Accessibility, On, Left and right to change\. '
key Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
wait '"Your damage, Every change, Left and right to change\. '
key Right
wait '\[a11y\] accessibility settings: saved match_announcements\.your_damage = Thresholds$'
ini '^match_announcements\.your_damage = Thresholds$'
key Down
wait "\"Opponents' damage, Every change, Left and right to change\. "
key Right
wait '\[a11y\] accessibility settings: saved match_announcements\.opponents_damage = Thresholds$'
ini '^match_announcements\.opponents_damage = Thresholds$'
key Escape Escape
wait '"Back to game"$'
sleep 1

# Start on the title screen goes straight into the debug match.
press Start until "boot scene: state \d+ scene 2$"
sleep 3

# Link walks over and jabs until Mario's damage crosses a threshold.
press Right 1200
search 'voice opponents: "\d+"$' A*40
wait 'voice opponents plays: "\d+" '

# Mario's attacks: Link's damage, once it crosses a threshold.
wait 'voice yours: "\d+"$' 60
wait 'voice yours plays: "\d+" '
sleep 1
